      50.64,
      376.2,
      286.44,
      645.92
    ],
    "text": "My Ref No.: GM/DS/2016/2/2/1/137. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/8/2016/HA/331. I, hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose :- Description of the land or servitude to be acquired : An allotment of Land in total extent of about 0.0104 hectare depicted as lot No. 1 in the P.P.GAM. No. 4110 dated 02.11.2018 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys- Gampaha Districts situated in the village called Moragoda, in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 233A of Moragoda II, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Gampaha of Gampaha District in Western Province and bounded as follows . 01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Kongahawatta alias Kamathgodellawatta or Godellawatta; Description of the Land: Home Garden, a permanent building available;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      5.9994001388549805,
      7.91920804977417,
