      539.62,
      367.76
    ],
    "text": "Claimants: J.A.M. Indrani Silva, No. 06, Moragoda, Gampaha; Extent : 0.0104 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      369.2,
      539.64,
      550.64
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Gampaha Divisional Secretariat on the 08th day of May 2019 at 10.00 a.m and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 29th day of April 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. K. A. S. Lakshreeni Gunathilake, Divisional Secretary/ Acquiring Officer, Gampaha Division.",
